              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Beth Miller"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The absolute best best PA Dutch pickled eggs, very simple. The juice from 4 cans of beets 3 cups of sugar 1 1/2 vinegar Bring to a boil, stirring constantly. Pour over hard boiled eggs, let them sit for at least 4 days.",
            "datePublished": "2022-03-01T15:04:46.264Z"
