              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CindyT"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great recipe for eggs! The pickling spices add a complexity of flavors and the wine adds a beautiful deep color. The only thing I would do different is cut back on the water, increase the wine and vinegar, and up the spices to a tablespoon.",
            "datePublished": "2011-06-23T08:53:18.630Z"
