            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Racky"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I followed the recipe at first was very good. I than tweeked it a tad.I ditched the red wine and the pickling spice.I upped the vinegar by half a cup.I left the beets in and sliced the onion thick. Spot on.I cant seem keep these around the family eats them faster than I can make them",
            "datePublished": "2009-10-09T12:32:22.260Z"
          },
          {
