            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Dan Slaughter"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Flavorless. Needs more vinegar. Suggest red wine vinegar double recipe quantity and subtract the wine from the recipe. Forget the pickling spice, it matters not. Don't chop onion either: slice it for better looks. Havn't tried my own suggestions, but it has got to be better.",
